/storage/*.key
# Each campaign gets its own storage tree, holding whatever it has had imported
# into it -- so these are a campaign's uploaded supporter lists, never anything
# authored here. They appear the moment anyone imports a list locally, and the
# test suite makes one per campaign it provisions.
/storage/tenant*
/storage/pail
# Written by the browser plugin when a browser test fails, and removed again on
# a green run -- so it exists exactly when someone is looking at a failure, and
# is untracked noise in the diff they are trying to read.
/tests/Browser/Screenshots
